        "instructions": [
          {
            "id": 484515,
            "primary_message": "Fill a large pot halfway with hot water (from the tap). Add salt, cover, and bring to a boil over high heat. Once boiling, uncover, add pasta, and stir for a few seconds; cook until desired firmness, 8-10 minutes. Drain pasta and set aside. (Reserve 1 cup pasta water before draining.)",
            "secondary_message": "1 tsp salt\n10 oz spaghetti pasta"
          },
          {
            "id": 484516,
            "primary_message": "Meanwhile, preheat a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
            "secondary_message": null
          },
          {
            "id": 484517,
            "primary_message": "While the skillet heats up, small dice tempeh. Place in a medium bowl, drizzle with soy sauce, then season with smoked paprika and salt. Stir to coat.",
            "secondary_message": "2 (8 oz) packages tempeh\n4 tsp soy sauce\n½ tsp smoked paprika\n⅛ tsp salt"
          },
          {
            "id": 484518,
            "primary_message": "Once the skillet is hot, add oil and swirl to coat the bottom. Add tempeh and cook, stirring occasionally, until golden, 4-5 minutes. Transfer tempeh to a plate and set aside. (Reserve skillet for later use.)",
            "secondary_message": "4 tsp extra virgin olive oil"
          },
          {
            "id": 484519,
            "primary_message": "Meanwhile, finely grate Parmesan. Divide between two additional medium bowls.",
            "secondary_message": "2 oz Parmesan cheese"
          },
          {
            "id": 484520,
            "primary_message": "Wash and dry the fresh produce.",
            "secondary_message": "1 small bunch Italian (flat-leaf) parsley\n1 lemon\n1 bunch kale"
          },
          {
            "id": 484521,
            "primary_message": "Shave parsley leaves off the stems; discard stems and mince the leaves. Add half to one of the bowls with the Parmesan. (Reserve remaining parsley for serving.) ",
            "secondary_message": null
          },
          {
            "id": 484522,
            "primary_message": "Add eggs, pepper, and salt to the bowl with the Parmesan and parsley. Whisk to combine the egg mixture and set aside.",
            "secondary_message": "2 eggs\n½ tsp black pepper\n¼ tsp salt"
          },
          {
            "id": 484523,
            "primary_message": "Juice lemon into the remaining bowl with the Parmesan. Add oil, crushed red pepper, and salt. Whisk to combine the dressing.",
            "secondary_message": "2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil\n½ tsp crushed red pepper\n½ tsp salt"
          },
          {
            "id": 484524,
            "primary_message": "Fold kale leaves in half lengthwise and slice off the stems; cut leaves crosswise into thin (shred-like) pieces. Add to the bowl with the dressing and, using your hands, massage kale until wilted, 1-2 minutes. Set aside.",
            "secondary_message": null
          },
          {
            "id": 484525,
            "primary_message": "When the pasta is done, return skillet to medium-high heat. Add drained pasta and cook, tossing frequently, until warmed through, about 1 minute. Remove from heat.",
            "secondary_message": null
          },
          {
            "id": 484526,
            "primary_message": "Carefully transfer warmed pasta to the bowl with the egg mixture. Tossing continuously, combine pasta with the egg mixture until pasta is glossy and evenly coated, 1-2 minutes. (The heat of the pasta will cook the egg.)",
            "secondary_message": null
          },
          {
            "id": 484527,
            "primary_message": "Add tempeh to the bowl with the pasta and toss once more to combine. Add reserved pasta water, 1 tablespoon at a time, if necessary, to loosen the pasta.",
            "secondary_message": null
          },
          {
            "id": 484528,
            "primary_message": "To serve, divide pasta and kale salad between plates or bowls. Top pasta with reserved parsley and enjoy!",
            "secondary_message": null
          }
        ],
